---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>404 — Personal Knowledge OS</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      color: #1f2933;
      max-width: 720px;
      padding: 4rem 1.25rem;
      margin-inline: auto;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    a { color: #1d4ed8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>404</h1>
  <p>这个地址没有对应的内容，或者它还未被发布。</p>
  <p><a href={base}>回到首页</a></p>
</body>
</html>
